From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noxwell <beebono@yahoo.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 03:59:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 113/225] arm64: dts: sprd: add Anbernic RG Rotate board +
 hwspinlock node

Add the RG Rotate (UMS512/T618) board DTS as a ums512_1h10 variant,
layering the device-specific deltas on upstream's generic ums512.dtsi.
Stage 1 wires what the upstream dtsi can back today: serial, microSD
(supplies + broken-cd + phy delays), eMMC, and the SC2730 fuel-gauge
battery telemetry. Remaining subsystems are tracked as an inline
checklist in the board file and land as their SoC nodes are ported.

Also port the hwspinlock SoC node (missing from upstream's ums512.dtsi)
back under aon bus@32000000 at offset 0x7f0000; the SC2730 ADC/efuse
that back the fuel gauge depend on the &hwlock phandle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/Makefile             |   1 +
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512-rg-rotate.dts | 162 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512.dtsi          |   8 +
 3 files changed, 171 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/ums512-rg-rotate.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/Makefile
index 0af83bf5f..e2679f3e9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/sprd/Makefile
@@ -3,5 +3,6 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SPRD) += sc9836-openphone.dtb 	\
 			sp9860g-1h10.dtb		\
 			sp9863a-1h10.dtb		\
 			ums512-1h10.dtb			\
+			ums512-rg-rotate.dtb		\
 			ums9230-reeder-s19mps.dtb	\
